<title>USA: Mich. $84.5 mln agency deal ylds 6.15 pct in 2027.</title>
<headline>Mich. $84.5 mln agency deal ylds 6.15 pct in 2027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Wednesday it tentatively priced $84.5 million Michigan State Housing Development Authority single-family mortgage revenue bonds at a top yield of 6.15 percent in 2027.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
